{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>資生堂The Collagen昇華版膠原蛋白抗醣丸126錠裝（Shiseido The Collagen Luxerich Tablets）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧及HKTVmall共3間零售商的網店報價。以同款單包標價計，最低與次低相差HK$83，約20%。</p>\n<h2>資生堂The Collagen昇華版膠原蛋白抗醣丸126錠裝｜單包網店價一覽</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單包標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單包總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜HKTVmall</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$332</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$332</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單包標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$415</td>\n<td>HK$415</td>\n<td>單包標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$415</td>\n<td>HK$415</td>\n<td>單包標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>資生堂The Collagen昇華版膠原蛋白抗醣丸126錠裝｜選購與包裝</h2>\n<p>買一包的話，HKTVmall列出HK$332，較表列次低標價HK$415少HK$83。這次比較紫色袋裝的The Collagen Luxerich昇華版126錠。比價時可看清楚包裝上的「Luxerich」字樣及錠數。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月19日商戶網上報價。價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源<a href=\"https://www.hktvmall.com/hktv/zh/main/watashi%2B-by-shiseido-hong-kong-%E8%B3%87%E7%94%9F%E5%A0%82%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%97%97%E8%89%A6%E5%BA%97/s/P0006001/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E7%94%A2%E5%93%81/%E7%BE%8E%E8%82%8C%E9%A3%9F%E5%93%81/%E6%98%87%E8%8F%AF%E7%89%88%E8%86%A0%E5%8E%9F%E8%9B%8B%E7%99%BD%E6%8A%97%E9%86%A3%E4%B8%B8%E2%80%AF126%E9%8C%A0%C2%A0/p/P0006001_S_10122429701\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HKTVmall</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/shiseido-the-collagen-luxerich-tablet-126pcs/p/313312\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/the-collagen-%E6%98%87%E8%8F%AF%E7%89%88%E8%86%A0%E5%8E%9F%E8%9B%8B%E7%99%BD%E6%8A%97%E9%86%A3%E4%B8%B8%E2%80%AF-126%E9%8C%A0-%C2%A0/p/BP_824012\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a></p>\n<p>屈臣氏香港列出的成分包括膠原蛋白肽及抗壞血酸。抗壞血酸即維他命C，人體製造膠原蛋白時需要維他命C。如對成分或服用有疑問，可先請教醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。資料來源<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/the-collagen-%E6%98%87%E8%8F%AF%E7%89%88%E8%86%A0%E5%8E%9F%E8%9B%8B%E7%99%BD%E6%8A%97%E9%86%A3%E4%B8%B8%E2%80%AF-126%E9%8C%A0-%C2%A0/p/BP_824012\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏香港產品標籤資料</a><a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/VitaminC-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIH ODS 維他命C資料</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（HK$415－HK$332）÷HK$415×100%，約20%。以上為表列同規格單包標價的比較，未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179502700703815707_136020376afdf03fa4059.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"資生堂The Collagen昇華版膠原蛋白抗醣丸126錠裝｜HKTVmall HK$332，同款單包價差約20%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179502700703815707_136020376afdf03fa4059.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>比較規格為每包126錠。購買前請核對實物標籤、包裝及商戶條款。</p>\n<p>對魚類過敏的人士要留意甚麼？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港產品資料列明含魚類製品。對魚類或標籤上其他成分過敏的人士，應先向醫生或藥劑師查詢。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T18:44:31.895356+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":786,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T18:36:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T23:57:52.775877+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T18:38:01.174513+00:00","content_hash":"eed60315f1142bceb9509fd772001033daea37c8c232b3f7949f8f67fe41bd68","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}